    "description": "Explore the world by Earth Map- Live Satellite View and enjoy Live Earth Map hd with live cam and world map.\r\nEarth Map- Live Satellite View presents live web cams of the world famous places. Earth Map Satellite shows the world map with street view and earth cam. Live Map Satellite is modified by using different modules of satellite map and webcam, tools and much more. You can plan your world tour with earth map satellite. Live Earth Map hd and Live Map Satellite will auto detect your location in its earth map view feature. Live Earth Map hd also provides the best navigation, live satellite view and street view. Route finder finds the distance between two points as it happens in driving directions. \r\nEarth Map Satellite also shows drone views and virtual tours of famous street view and live satellite view. Earth Map- Live Satellite View user can experience his area in satellite view, webcam, 3d view, 2d view and street view.\r\nLive Satellite View - street view is capable to display all natural places beauty around you. You may search webcam and explore world map around you by using Earth map satellite. Live earth map hd has the feature of night view, terrain view, map view and satellite view. User can find satellite images, 3d buildings and virtual tours of famous places and wonders around the globe with world map.\r\nTop features of Earth Map- Live Satellite View & Satellite Map\r\n\r\n Earth Map satellite is free to download.\r\n\r\n Earth Map- Live Satellite View has free premium features e.g. Live Webs Cams, Street Views.\r\n\r\n World map has simple and attractive user interface.\r\n\r\nSatellite map shows street view in 3d model.\r\n\r\nThis app can calculate the exact distance between two points.\r\n\r\n By using this app, you can get your current address and copy that address.\r\n This app shows live web cams, earth cam and live cam drone views of famous cities and space weather and images. \r\n\r\nLive Map Satellite can show any place in the world, 3d buildings and beautiful cities around the world.\r\n\r\n This app contains Tools feature which has Compass, age calculator and many more.\r\n Zoom in and zoom out functionality is available in this application.\r\nEarth Map- Live Satellite View has space related information and updates its user with different satellite map locations. Live Map Satellite includes astronomy pictures and different space views.\r\n\r\nLive Earth Map hd contains a different module of tools which is highly precise and contains solution for the basic utilities of users.\r\n\r\nCompass can be used to find exact directions in any area. \r\n\r\nAge calculator is the utility feature in Earth Map Satellite. You may calculate your exact age by using that feature.\r\n\r\nLive cams which are installed around the globe in attractive earth places are ready to entertain you in live cams feature. \r\n\r\nExplore the whole world from above with satellite view in real time. You may visit terrain of the entire globe, street views and 3D buildings in hundreds of cities around the world. \r\nSee the world from a new point of view with satellite maps in real time, Live web cams and more.\r\n\u201cEarth land marks\u201d is one of the salient features of this Earth Map- Live Satellite View app which provides famous land marks on earth with images and videos. You will enjoy the beautiful landmarks on earth with satellite view and satellite map.\r\nLive satellite view and navigation app will help the user to find the best and exact navigation and route draw. It will draw a route or distance between two points. It will detect the exact current location and will navigate to the destination location.\r\n\r\nJust download the Earth Map- Live Satellite View and you are good to go for street views, earth cam, street view map, real-time earth, world map, space info, live cam, satellite views, tools and more.",
